#: ../smart-base/processes/content/l2-component-edit-review.bpmn:57
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "A person, never the agent, in the role the call names for this component: the clinical SME for business processes, decision logic, personas and scenarios; the terminologist for terminology bindings and the glossary's codes, since the person who chose a code does not review it; the business analyst with the programme manager for indicators and requirements. Each takes on this generic reviewer lane for the call path only (review-task.bpmn), so the reviewer of a DMN table does not statically carry the terminologist's skills. Reads the staged component, its before/after and its checker's findings; the preview is made in the agent's lane and only read here."
msgstr ""

#: ../smart-base/processes/content/l2-component-edit-review.bpmn:140
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "adjudication: pending on derived edges becomes the recorded outcome."
msgstr ""

